 as European Union defense ministers discuss the "hybrid" threat from Moscow in Europe. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>AfD's Ulrich Siegmund has plans for Saxony-Anhalt and beyond</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:341a80ed5dc3232e317b2a15c4a7c93048a2b8821dd94f7c8a33dc073aeac4e5</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T04:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/afd-s-ulrich-siegmund-has-plans-for-saxony-anhalt-and-beyond/a-78579499--545f2fff9447.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afd-s-ulrich-siegmund-has-plans-for-saxony-anhalt-and-beyond/a-78579499?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AfD's lead candidate in the upcoming election aims to turn his small federal state into a blueprint for right-wing extremist politics across Germany.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Tupac Shakur murder trial: Duane 'Keffe D' Davis guilty</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c03930178b7aa727be13253d8b768eaa172beef2e3715df238e2ddbe6f02a175</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T00:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tupac-shakur-murder-trial-duane-keffe-d-davis-guilty/a-78581756--4c1e638bfbaa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tupac-shakur-murder-trial-duane-keffe-d-davis-guilty/a-78581756?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The jury reached a verdict in less than three hours in a case that had been unsolved for nearly 30 years. Davis was convicted of murder with the use of a deadly weapon and could be sentenced to life in prison.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US Supreme Court allows Trump ballroom project to proceed</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:54d3e859324a43e84f165592a76c0a6eb0238aed6928beceadc68e7a46d926ff</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T21:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-supreme-court-allows-trump-ballroom-project-to-proceed/a-78581275--658a7a0b4caa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-supreme-court-allows-trump-ballroom-project-to-proceed/a-78581275?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The ruling was backed by five of the court's six conservative justices. US President Donald Trump praised the decision in a post on his Truth Social platform.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland launches sabotage probe in drone factory fire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:769c1313bc8105a03abf5ead2f78b2c6442c531b9b810bd11d640f6278a8d49f</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T19:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-launches-sabotage-probe-in-drone-factory-fire/a-78580918--79cf72f3a61f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-launches-sabotage-probe-in-drone-factory-fire/a-78580918?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">According to the prosecution, the fire that occurred at a drone factory 150 kilometers south of Warsaw was deliberately set.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Lionel Messi announces retirement from international football</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4f815076200887bf97198a38c40e049037459ec704829b99855720763faeef6d</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T15:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/lionel-messi-announces-retirement-from-international-football/a-78579502--d168058a6b27.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/lionel-messi-announces-retirement-from-international-football/a-78579502?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Argentine legend announced that he will not play for the national team again, ending an illustrious international career.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Court says India must uphold Pakistan water treaty</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9280b64fc14c598d02d980f3fe9673883791f69194de734e6e28215431376e73</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/court-says-india-must-uphold-pakistan-water-treaty/a-78579010--8d02fdf8eecf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/court-says-india-must-uphold-pakistan-water-treaty/a-78579010?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An international tribunal has ordered India to "observe its obligations" under a water-treaty with Pakistan.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How China buried Tibet flood images after Nepal disaster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:90f8d0ddda35e139b370b7824570166bae21105ac8fe7c13154c0a51f0f51f72</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472--01797a43cf24.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In Tibet, a digital crackdown followed the deadly flood that has devastated communities along the China-Nepal border. Censors erased viral footage while Chinese state media flooded platforms with official content.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>At Venice Film Festival, politics take center stage</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:55ad2f87cdf8ab9705a80e4969702b115d35d067b90db37761f9f1d41eaf3abe</id><updated>2026-09-01T13:33:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/at-venice-film-festival-politics-take-center-stage/a-78493761--e7dc63ca25d5.html" type="t